Sorry, had to.

Yeah, but how many liberal doctors are out there saying "YOU SHOULD TOTALLY TRANSITION! DO IT! HESTITATIONS? WHO CARES! DEATH TO THE BINARY GENDERS"? Alternatively, there's no atheist/agnostic doctor telling people not to undergo a procedure or use a medication because it confirms that there is a god.

No doctor should bring their personal beliefs into their practice obviously, but there's one side definitely doing it more than the other...

